{"id":"e8ea39af9a8003f5","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-extensional-class.md","title":"ZFC Extensional Class","display":"df-zfc-extensional-class — ZFC Extensional Class","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-extensional-class","aliases":["58-df-zfc-extensional-class"],"display":"df-zfc-extensional-class — ZFC Extensional Class","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-class]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-extensional-class"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-extensional-class</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-extensional-class — ZFC Extensional Class"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" href=\"?note=ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" title=\"58-df-class\">58-df-class</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> (class whose inherited membership structure is tested), with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Class}_S(C)\">\\(\\mathrm{Class}_S(C)\\)</span> as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" href=\"?note=ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" title=\"58-df-class\">58-df-class</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcExtensionalClass}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcExtensionalClass}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}extensional\\text{-}class}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcExtensionalClass}_S[C]\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Class}_S(C)\\land\\forall x,y\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nx\\in C\\land y\\in C\n\\land\\forall z\\in V\\;(z\\in C\\to(z\\in x\\leftrightarrow z\\in y))\n\\to x=y\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}extensional\\text{-}class}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcExtensionalClass}_S[C]\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Class}_S(C)\\land\\forall x,y\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nx\\in C\\land y\\in C\n\\land\\forall z\\in V\\;(z\\in C\\to(z\\in x\\leftrightarrow z\\in y))\n\\to x=y\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is extensionality of the inherited membership relation on a possibly proper class. Square brackets and the metatheoretic turnstile mark the class parameter; all displayed object quantifiers still range over sets in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-class","status":"resolved","id":"ca2a9c9166fa8cce","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-class","status":"resolved","id":"ca2a9c9166fa8cce","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$C$ (class whose inherited membership structure is tested), with $\\mathrm{Class}_S(C)$ as in [[58-df-class]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Class}_S(C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcExtensionalClass}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}extensional\\text{-}class}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcExtensionalClass}_S[C]\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Class}_S(C)\\land\\forall x,y\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nx\\in C\\land y\\in C\n\\land\\forall z\\in V\\;(z\\in C\\to(z\\in x\\leftrightarrow z\\in y))\n\\to x=y\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"V","display":false}],"bytes":1031,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1871","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-extensional-class.md|58-df-zfc-extensional-class]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","ca2a9c9166fa8cce"]}